# Repository contract

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root before changing code. It is the canonical
source for language boundaries, supported providers, runtime invariants, and
required verification; keep those decisions there instead of duplicating them
in editor-specific rules.

Read `docs/README.md` and the relevant component documentation. The `tnytty/`
sibling has its own contract under `tnytty/docs/`. Update the applicable docs
when behavior changes.
